  "core_design_rules": [
    "The Merchant is battle-oriented and uses economic flavor as combat mechanics rather than literal shop simulation.",
    "Capital is a combat resource and should not depend directly on the player's gold inventory.",
    "Pushcart is the central enabling system of the class.",
    "Change Cart should alter combat behavior in meaningful ways rather than being cosmetic only.",
    "Mammonite is the Merchant's signature burst attack.",
    "Supply Station is the BG3-friendly reinterpretation of Vending.",
    "Cart Revolution is the Merchant's defining cart-based area attack and control skill."
  ]
